# G-WIN AI Detective — environment variables
# This prototype runs entirely on demo/sample data and does NOT require any API keys.
#
# When you connect a real AI vision model later, add the relevant keys below
# and reference them in src/lib/analysis.ts (the single swap point for the
# demo analysis engine).
#
# Example (uncomment and fill in when ready):
# VITE_AI_VISION_API_KEY=your-key-here
